<name>Location 38</name>
<description><![CDATA[<h3>Location 38</h3><p><strong>Hosts:</strong><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/host/creative-arts-society-group-exhibit/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_2437.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Creative Arts Society Group Exhibit</a></p><hr/><p><strong>Artists:</strong><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/ann-yaki-art/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/New_Garden_Gate_2_Ann_Yakimovicz.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Ann Yaki Art</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/billy-moore-photography/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/1000x750_fit.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Billy Moore photography</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/bryan-petro/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/480138353_17893221540164588_4701483301662128537_n.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Bryan Petro</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/creative-arts-society/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Tree_of_Life_013024.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Creative Arts Society</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/curran-photo-llc-ron-curran/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Crater_Lake_Jump_1.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Curran Photo LLC – Ron Curran</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/denise-elliott-jones/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_2139.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Denise Elliott Jones</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/elizabeth-atkinson/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_3927.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Elizabeth Atkinson</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/eva-glock/"><img src="https: