ichelle-rankin/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Michelle_Rankin___Prickly_Pear_Pinata___low_res.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Michelle Rankin</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/poppy-pena/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/IMG_9887.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Poppy Peña</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/rick-hastie-fine-art-photography/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/2Rick_Hastie.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Rick Hastie Fine Art photography</a><br/><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/art/tim-schmidt-art/"><img src="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ArtShack.jpg" style="max-width:200px;height:auto;"/>Tim Schmidt Art</a></p><hr/><p><a href="https://www.atxstudiotour.com/location/location-38/">View on ATX Studio Tour</a></p>]]></description>
